{
  "title": "Aamal & Duas for the Days of Ramazan",
  "data": "اَللّٰهُمَّ هٰذَا شَهْرُ رَمَضَانَ\nALLAAHUMMA HAADHAA SHAHRU RAMADAAN\nO Allah, this is the month of Ramadan\nالَّذِيْ اَنْزَلْتَ فِيْهِ الْقُرْاٰنَ\nALLADHEE ANZALTA FEEHIL QUR'AAN\nin which You revealed the Qur'an,\nهُدَىً لِلنَّاسِ وَبَيِّنَاتٍ مِنَ الْهُدٰى وَالْفُرْقَانِ\nHUDAL LINNAASI WA BAYYINAATIN MINAL HUDAA WAL FURQAAN\na guidance for humankind and clear proofs of true guidance and distinction (between the right and the wrong).\nوَهٰذَا شَهْرُ الصِّيَامِ\nWA HAADHAA SHAHRUS SIYAAM\nThis is the month of observing fasting.\nوَهٰذَا شَهْرُ الْقِيَامِ\nWA HAADHAA SHAHRUL QIYAAM\nThis is the month of acts of worship.\nوَهٰذَا شَهْرُ الْاِنَابَةِ\nWA HAADHAA SHAHRUL INAABAH\nThis is the month of turning to You (in penitence).\nوَهٰذَا شَهْرُ التَّوْبَةِ\nWA HAADHAA SHAHRUT TAWBAH\nThis is the month of repentance.\nوَهٰذَا شَهْرُ الْمَغْفِرَةِ وَالرَّحْمَةِ\nWA HAADHAA SHAHRUL MAGHFIRATI WAR RAHMAH\nThis is the month of forgiveness and mercy.\nوَهٰذَا شَهْرُ الْعِتْقِ مِنَ النَّارِ وَالْفَوْزِ بِالْجَنَّةِ\nWA HAADHAA SHAHRUL I'TQI MINAN NAARI WAL FAWZI BIL JANNAH\nThis is the month of release from Hellfire and winning Paradise.\nوَهٰذَا شَهْرٌ فِيْهِ لَيْلَةُ الْقَدْرِ\nWA HAADHAA SHAHRUN FEEHI LAYLATUL QADR\nThis is the month in which there is the Destiny Night,\nالَّتِيْ هِيَ خَيْرٌ مِنْ اَلْفِ شَهْرٍ\nALLATEE HIYA KHAYRUN MIN ALFI SHAHR\nwhich is better than one thousand months.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ فَصَلِّ عَلٰى مُحَمَّدٍ وَاٰلِ مُحَمَّدٍ\nALLAAHUMMA FASALLI A'LAA MUHAMMADIN WA AALI MUHAMMAD\nO Allah, (please do) bless Muhammad and the Household of Muhammad,\nوَاَعِنِّي عَلٰى صِيَامِهٖ وَقِيَامِهٖ\nWA A'INNEE A'LAA SIYAAMIHEE WA QIYAAMIH\nhelp me observe fasting and do acts of worship during it,\nوَسَلِّمْهُ لِي وَسَلِّمْنِيْ فِيْهِ\nWA SALLIMHU LEE WA SALLIMNEE FEEH\nkeep it upright for me, keep me safe during it,\nوَاَعِنِّي عَلَيْهِ بِاَفْضَلِ عَوْنِكَ\nWA A'INNEE A'LAYHI BI-AFDALI A'WNIK\nhelp me observe it with the best of Your help,\nوَوَفِّقْنِيْ فِيْهِ لِطَاعَتِكَ وَطَاعَةِ رَسُولِكَ وَاَوْلِيَآئِكَ\nWA WAFFIQNEE FEEHI LITAA'ATIKA WA TAA'ATI RASOOLIKA WA AWLIYAA'IK\nmake me succeed in doing acts of obedience to You, to Your Prophet, and Your intimate servants\nصَلَّى اللهُ عَلَيْهِمْ\nSALLALLAAHU A'LAYHIM\nupon whom be Your blessings.\nوَفَرِّغْنِي فِيْهِ لِعِبَادَتِكَ وَدُعَاۤئِكَ وَتِلَاوَةِ كِتَابِكَ\nWA FARRIGHNEE FEEHI LI-I'BAADATIKA WA DU'AA'IKA WA TILAAWATI KITAABIK\nMake me devote myself to acts of worship to You, to praying You, and to reciting Your Book,\nوَاَعْظِمْ لِيْ فِيْهِ الْبَرَكَةَ\nWA A'ZIM LEE FEEHIL BARAKAH\nincrease its blessings for me,\nوَاَحْسِنْ لِي فِيْهِ الْعَافِيَةَ\nWA AHSIN LEE FEEHIL A'AFIYAH\nconfer upon me with good health during it,\nوَاَصِحَّ فِيْهِ بَدَنِيْ\nWA ASIHHA FEEHI BADANEE\nmake my body healthy during it,\nوَاَوْسِعْ لِيْ فِيْهِ رِزْقِيْ\nWA AWSI' LEE FEEHI RIZQEE\nexpand my sustenance during it,\nوَاكْفِنِيْ فِيْهِ مَآ اَهَمَّنِيْ\nWAKFINEE FEEHI MAA AHAMMANEE\nsave me from whatever aggrieves me during it,\nوَاسْتَجِبْ فِيْهِ دُعَاۤئِي\nWASTAJIB FEEHI DU'AA'EE\nrespond to my prayers during it,\nوَبَلِّغْنِيْ رَجَاۤئِيْ\nWA BALLIGHNEE RAJAA'EE\nand make me attain my hope during it.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ صَلِّ عَلٰى مُحَمَّدٍ وَاٰلِ مُحَمَّدٍ\nALLAAHUMMA SALLI A'LAA MUHAMMADIN WA AALI MUHAMMAD\nO Allah, (please do) bless Muhammad and the Household of Muhammad,\nوَاَذْهِبْ عَنِّي فِيْهِ النُّعَاسَ وَالْكَسَلَ وَالسَّاْمَةَ\nWA ADH-HIB A'NNEE FEEHIN NU'AASA WAL KASALA WAS SA'MAH\nremove from me during it drowsiness, lethargy, laziness,\nوَالْفَتْرَةَ وَالْقَسْوَةَ وَالْغَفْلَةَ وَالْغِرَّةَ\nWAL FATRATA WAL QASWATA WAL GHAFLATA WAL GHIRRAH\nweariness, hardheartedness, inattentiveness, and carelessness.\nوَجَنِّبْنِيْ فِيْهِ الْعِلَلَ وَالْاَسْقَامَ\nWA JANNIBNEE FEEHIL I'LALA WAL ASQAAM\nPut aside from me during it illnesses, sicknesses,\nوَالْهُمُوْمَ وَالْاَحْزَانَ\nWAL HUMOOMA WAL AHZAAN\ngrievances, sorrows,\nوَالْاَعْرَاضَ وَالْاَمْرَاضَ\nWAL A'RAADA WAL AMRAAD\nailments, diseases,\nوَالْخَطَايَا وَالذُّنُوْبَ\nWAL KHATAAYAA WADH DHUNOOB\nwrongdoings, and sins.\nوَاصْرِفْ عَنِّيْ فِيْهِ السُّوْءَ وَالْفَحْشَاۤءَ\nWASRIF A'NNEE FEEHIS SOO'A WAL FAHSHAA'\nSend away from me during it evil, indecency,\nوَالْجَهْدَ وَالْبَلَاۤءَ\nWAL JAHDA WAL BALAA'\nfatigue, ordeals,\nوَالتَّعَبَ وَالْعَنَاۤءَ\nWAT TA'ABA WAL A'NAA'\ntiredness, and suffering.\nاِنَّكَ سَمِيْعُ الدُّعَاۤءِ\nINNAKA SAMEE'UD DU'AA'\nVerily, You are the Hearer of prayers.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ صَلِّ عَلٰى مُحَمَّدٍ وَاٰلِ مُحَمَّدٍ\nALLAAHUMMA SALLI A'LAA MUHAMMADIN WA AALI MUHAMMAD\nO Allah, (please do) bless Muhammad and the Household of Muhammad\nوَاَعِذْنِيْ فِيْهِ مِنَ الشَّيْطَانِ الرَّجِيْمِ\nWA A'IDHNEE FEEHI MINASH SHAYTAANIR RAJEEM\nand protect me during it from Satan the cursed,\nوَهَمْزِهٖ وَلَمْزِهٖ وَنَفْثِهٖ وَنَفْخِهٖ\nWA HAMZIHEE WA LAMZIHEE WA NAFTHIHEE WA NAFKHIH\nhis sting, his slander, his devilry,\nوَوَسْوَسَتِهٖ وَتَثْبِيْطِهٖ وَبَطْشِهٖ وَكَيْدِهٖ\nWA WASWASATIHEE WA TATHBEETIHEE WA BATSHIHEE WA KAYDIH\nhis evil inspirations, his frustration, his obstinacy, his trickeries,\nوَمَكْرِهٖ وَحَبَآئِلِهٖ وَخُدَعِهٖ وَاَمَانِيِّهٖ\nWA MAKRIHEE WA HABAA'ILIHEE WA KHUDA'IHEE WA AMAANIYYIH\nhis deceptions, his traps, his scams, his false hopes,\nوَغُرُوْرِهٖ وَفِتْنَتِهٖ وَشَرَكِهٖ وَاَحْزَابِهٖ\nWA GHUROORIHEE WA FITNATIHEE WA SHARAKIHEE WA AHZAABIH\nhis vanities, his seductions, his ruses, his allies,\nوَاَتْبَاعِهٖ وَاَشْيَاعِهٖ وَاَوْلِيَآئِهٖ وَشُرَكَآئِهٖ\nWA ATBAA'IHEE WA ASHYAA'IHEE WA AWLIYAA'IHEE WA SHURAKAA'IH\nhis followers, his fans, his supporters, his partners,\nوَجَمِيْعِ مَكَآئِدِهٖ\nWA JAMEE'I MAKAA'IDIH\nand all his snares.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ صَلِّ عَلٰى مُحَمَّدٍ وَاٰلِ مُحَمَّدٍ\nALLAAHUMMA SALLI A'LAA MUHAMMADIN WA AALI MUHAMMAD\nO Allah, (please do) bless Muhammad and the Household of Muhammad\nوَارْزُقْنَا قِيَامَهٗ وَصِيَامَهٗ\nWARZUQNAA QIYAAMAHOO WA SIYAAMAH\nand bestow upon us with the observance of fasting, acts of worship,\nوَبُلُوْغَ الْاَمَلِ فِيْهِ وَفِيْ قِيَامِهٖ\nWA BULOOGHAL AMALI FEEHI WA FEE QIYAAMIH\nattainment of our hopes during it, by means of doing acts of worship in it,\nوَاسْتِكْمَالَ مَا يُرْضِيْكَ عَنِّيْ\nWASTIKMAALA MAA YURDEEKA A'NNEE\naccomplishment of that which brings about Your pleasure\nصَبْرًا وَاحْتِسَابًا وَاِيْمَانًا وَيَقِيْنًا\nSABRAN WAHTISAABAN WA EEMAANAN WA YAQEENAA\nby means of steadfastness, acting for Your sake, faith and certitude.\nثُمَّ تَقَبَّلْ ذٰلِكَ مِنِّيْ بِالْاَضْعَافِ الْكَثِيْرَةِ\nTHUMMA TAQABBAL DHAALIKA MINNEE BIL AD'AAFIL KATHEERAH\nThen (please) admit all that from me with manifold rewards\nوَالْاَجْرِ الْعَظِيْمِ\nWAL AJRIL A'ZEEM\nand great gifts.\nيَا رَبَّ الْعَالَمِيْنَ\nYAA RABBAL A'ALAMEEN\nO Lord of the worlds!\nاَللّٰهُمَّ صَلِّ عَلٰى مُحَمَّدٍ وَاٰلِ مُحَمَّدٍ\nALLAAHUMMA SALLI A'LAA MUHAMMADIN WA AALI MUHAMMAD\nO Allah, (please do) bless Muhammad and the Household of Muhammad\nوَارْزُقْنِي الْحَجَّ وَالْعُمْرَةَ\nWARZUQNIL HAJJA WAL U'MRAH\nand grant me (the opportunity to go on) Hajj, 'Umrah,\nوَالْجِدَّ وَالْاِجْتِهَادَ\nWAL JIDDA WAL IJTIHAAD\nhard work, painstakingness,\nوَالْقُوَّةَ وَالنَّشَاطَ\nWAL QUWWATA WAN NASHAAT\npower, activity,\nوَالْاِنَابَةَ وَالتَّوْبَةَ\nWAL INAABATA WAT TAWBAH\nturning to You, repentance,\nوَالتَّوْفِيْقَ وَالْقُرْبَةَ\nWAT TAWFEEQA WAL QURBAH\nsuccess, seeking Your nearness,\nوَالْخَيْرَ الْمَقْبُوْلَ وَالرَّغْبَةَ وَالرَّهْبَةَ\nWAL KHAYRAL MAQBOOLA WAR RAGHBATA WAR RAHBAH\nadmitted good-doing, desire (for You), fear (from You),\nوَالتَّضَرُّعَ وَالْخُشُوْعَ\nWAT TADARRU'A WAL KHUSHOO'\nsubmission (to You), meekness,\nوَالرِّقَّةَ وَالنِّيَّةَ الصَّادِقَةَ\nWAR RIQQATA WAN NIYYATAS SAADIQAH\ntenderness, sincere intention,\nوَصِدْقَ اللِّسَانِ\nWA SIDQAL LISAAN\ntruthfulness,\nوَالْوَجَلَ مِنْكَ\nWAL WAJALA MINK\ndread from You,\nوَالرَّجَاۤءَ لَكَ\nWAR RAJAA'A LAK\nhope for You,\nوَالتَّوَكُّلَ عَلَيْكَ\nWAT TAWAKKULA A'LAYK\nreliance upon You,\nوَالثِّقَةَ بِكَ\nWATH THIQATA BIK\ntrust in You,\nوَالْوَرَعَ عَنْ مَحَارِمِكَ\nWAL WARA'A A'N MAHAARIMIK\nand abstention from committing that which You have deemed unlawful,\nمَعَ صَالِحِ الْقَوْلِ\nMA'A SAALIHIL QAWL\nalong with decent speaking,\nوَمَقْبُوْلِ السَّعْيِ\nWA MAQBOOLIS SA'Y\nadmitted efforts,\nوَمَرْفُوْعِ الْعَمَلِ\nWA MARFOO'IL A'MAL\nelevated deeds,\nوَمُسْتَجَابِ الدَّعْوَةِ\nWA MUSTAJAABID DA'WAH\nand responded prayers.\nوَلَا تَحُلْ بَيْنِي وَبَيْنَ شَيْءٍ مِنْ ذٰلِكَ\nWA LAA TAHUL BAYNEE WA BAYNA SHAY'IN MIN DHAALIK\nDo not let anything intervene between me and any of these matters,\nبِعَرَضٍ وَلَا مَرَضٍ\nBI-A'RADIN WA LAA MARAD\nsuch as an accidental event, disease,\nوَلَا هَمٍّ وَلَا غَمٍّ\nWA LAA HAMMIN WA LAA GHAMM\ngrief, unhappiness,\nوَلَا سُقْمٍ وَلَا غَفْلَةٍ وَلَا نِسْيَانٍ\nWA LAA SUQMIN WA LAA GHAFLATIN WA LAA NISYAAN\nailment, inadvertence, or oblivion;\nبَلْ بِالتَّعَاهُدِ وَالتَّحَفُّظِ لَكَ وَفِيْكَ\nBAL BIT TA'AAHUDI WAT TAHAFFUZI LAKA WA FEEK\nrather, (help me do all that) with observance, carefulness to You and for Your sake,\nوَالرِّعَايَةِ لِحَقِّكَ وَالْوَفَاۤءِ بِعَهْدِكَ وَوَعْدِكَ\nWAR RI'AAYATI LIHAQQIKA WAL WAFAA'I BI-A'HDIKA WA WA'DIK\nadherence to that which is incumbent upon me towards You, and fulfillment of my covenant and promise to You.\nبِرَحْمَتِكَ يَآ اَرْحَمَ الرَّاحِمِيْنَ\nBIRAHMATIKA YAA ARHAMAR RAAHIMEEN\n(let all that be) in the name of Your mercy, O most Merciful of all those who show mercy!\nاَللّٰهُمَّ صَلِّ عَلٰى مُحَمَّدٍ وَاٰلِ مُحَمَّدٍ\nALLAAHUMMA SALLI A'LAA MUHAMMADIN WA AALI MUHAMMAD\nO Allah, (please do) bless Muhammad and the Household of Muhammad,\nوَاقْسِمْ لِي فِيْهِ اَفْضَلَ مَا تَقْسِمُهٗ لِعِبَادِكَ الصَّالِحِيْنَ\nWAQSIM LEE FEEHI AFDALA MAA TAQSIMUHOO LI-I'BAADIKAS SAALIHEEN\ndecide for me during this month the best of that which You decide for Your righteous servants,\nوَاَعْطِنِيْ فِيْهِ اَفْضَلَ مَا تُعْطِيْ اَوْلِيَاۤءَكَ الْمُقَرَّبِيْنَ\nWA A'TINEE FEEHI AFDALA MAA TU'TEE AWLIYAA'AKAL MUQARRABEEN\nand give me during it the most favorable of that which You give to Your intimate and favorite servants;\nمِنَ الرَّحْمَةِ وَالْمَغْفِرَةِ وَالتَّحَنُّنِ وَالْاِجَابَةِ\nMINAR RAHMATI WAL MAGHFIRATI WAT TAHANNUNI WAL IJAABAH\nsuch as mercy, forgiveness, kindness, responding (of prayers),\nوَالْعَفْوِ وَالْمَغْفِرَةِ الدَّآئِمَةِ وَالْعَافِيَةِ وَالْمُعَافَاةِ\nWAL A'FWI WAL MAGHFIRATID DAA'IMATI WAL A'AFIYATI WAL MU'AAFAAH\npardon, perpetual forgiveness, good health, continuous wellbeing,\nوَالْعِتْقِ مِنَ النَّارِ وَالْفَوْزِ بِالْجَنَّةِ\nWAL I'TQI MINAN NAARI WAL FAWZI BIL JANNAH\nrelease from Hellfire, winning Paradise,\nوَخَيْرِ الدُّنْيَا وَالْاٰخِرَةِ\nWA KHAYRID DUNYAA WAL AAKHIRAH\nand the goodness of this worldly life and the Next World.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ صَلِّ عَلٰى مُحَمَّدٍ وَاٰلِ مُحَمَّدٍ\nALLAAHUMMA SALLI A'LAA MUHAMMADIN WA AALI MUHAMMAD\nO Allah, (please do) bless Muhammad and the Household of Muhammad\nوَاجْعَلْ دُعَاۤئِيْ فِيْهِ اِلَيْكَ وَاصِلًا\nWAJ'AL DU'AA'EE FEEHI ILAYKA WAASILAA\nand cause my prayers during this month to reach You,\nوَرَحْمَتَكَ وَخَيْرَكَ اِلَيَّ فِيْهِ نَازِلًا\nWA RAHMATAKA WA KHAYRAKA ILAYYA FEEHI NAAZILAA\nYour mercy and goodness during it to reach me,\nوَعَمَلِيْ فِيْهِ مَقْبُوْلًا\nWA A'MALEE FEEHI MAQBOOLAA\nmy deed to be accepted (by You),\nوَسَعْيِيْ فِيْهِ مَشْكُوْرًا\nWA SA'YEE FEEHI MASHKOORAA\nmy efforts during it to be praiseworthy,\nوَذَنْبِيْ فِيْهِ مَغْفُوْرًا\nWA DHANBEE FEEHI MAGHFOORAA\nand my sins during it to be forgiven\nحَتّٰى يَكُوْنَ نَصِيْبِيْ فِيْهِ الْاَكْثَرَ\nHATTAA YAKOONA NASEEBEE FEEHIL AKTHAR\nso that my share (of Your awards) shall be the most abundant,\nوَحَظِّيْ فِيْهِ الْاَوْفَرَ\nWA HAZZEE FEEHIL AWFAR\nand my portion the most copious.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ صَلِّ عَلٰى مُحَمَّدٍ وَاٰلِ مُحَمَّدٍ\nALLAAHUMMA SALLI A'LAA MUHAMMADIN WA AALI MUHAMMAD\nO Allah, (please do) bless Muhammad and the Household of Muhammad\nوَوَفِّقْنِيْ فِيْهِ لِلَيْلَةِ الْقَدْرِ\nWA WAFFIQNEE FEEHI LILAYLATIL QADR\nand guide me to observe the Destiny Night adequately,\nعَلٰى اَفْضَلِ حَالٍ تُحِبُّ اَنْ يَكُوْنَ عَلَيْهَا اَحَدٌ مِنْ اَوْلِيَآئِكَ وَاَرْضَاهَا لَكَ\nA'LAA AFDALI HAALIN TUHIBBU AN YAKOONA A'LAYHAA AHADUN MIN AWLIYAA'IKA WA ARDAAHAA LAK\nbeing in the most favorable and most pleased state that You would like to notice from any of Your intimate servants.\nثُمَّ اجْعَلْهَا لِيْ خَيْرًا مِنْ اَلْفِ شَهْرٍ\nTHUMMAJ A'LHAA LEE KHAYRAN MIN ALFI SHAHR\nThen, decide it to be better for me than one thousand months,\nوَارْزُقْنِيْ فِيْهَا اَفْضَلَ مَا رَزَقْتَ اَحَدًا مِمَّنْ بَلَّغْتَهٗ اِيَّاهَا وَاَكْرَمْتَهٗ بِهَا\nWARZUQNEE FEEHAA AFDALA MAA RAZAQTA AHADAN MIMMAN BALLAGHTAHOO IYYAAHAA WA AKRAMTAHOO BIHAA\nconfer upon me during this night the best conferrals that You ever confer upon any one whom You guide to attain it and whom You honor during it,\nوَاجْعَلْنِيْ فِيْهَا مِنْ عُتَقَآئِكَ مِنْ جَهَنَّمَ\nWAJ'ALNEE FEEHAA MIN U'TAQAA'IKA MIN JAHANNAM\ninclude me at this night it with those whom You release from Hell\nوَطُلَقَآئِكَ مِنَ النَّارِ\nWA TULAQAA'IKA MINAN NAAR\nwhom You manumit from Hellfire\nوَسُعَدَاۤءِ خَلْقِكَ بِمَغْفِرَتِكَ وَرِضْوَانِكَ\nWA SU'ADAA'I KHALQIKA BIMAGHFIRATIKA WA RIDWAANIK\nand with those of Your creatures who are happy due to Your forgiveness and satisfaction (that reach them).\nيَا اَرْحَمَ الرَّاحِمِيْنَ\nYAA ARHAMAR RAAHIMEEN\nO most Merciful of all those who show mercy!\nاَللّٰهُمَّ صَلِّ عَلٰى مُحَمَّدٍ وَاٰلِ مُحَمَّدٍ\nALLAAHUMMA SALLI A'LAA MUHAMMADIN WA AALI MUHAMMAD\nO Allah, (please do) bless Muhammad and the Household of Muhammad\nوَارْزُقْنَا فِيْ شَهْرِنَا هٰذَا الْجِدَّ وَالْاِجْتِهَادَ\nWARZUQNAA FEE SHAHRINAA HAADHAL JIDDA WAL IJTIHAAD\nand grant us during this month hard working, exactness,\nوَالْقُوَّةَ وَالنَّشَاطَ\nWAL QUWWATA WAN NASHAAT\npower, activeness,\nوَمَا تُحِبُّ وَتَرْضٰى\nWA MAA TUHIBBU WA TARDAA\nand whatever You like and please.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ رَبَّ الْفَجْرِ وَلَيَالٍ عَشْرٍ وَالشَّفْعِ وَالْوَتْرِ\nALLAAHUMMA RABBAL FAJRI WA LAYAALIN A'SHRIN WASH SHAF'I WAL WATR\nO Allah, the Lord of the Dawn, the Ten Nights, the Even and the Odd,\nوَرَبَّ شَهْرِ رَمَضَانَ وَمَا اَنْزَلْتَ فِيْهِ مِنَ الْقُرْاٰنِ\nWA RABBA SHAHRI RAMADAANA WA MAA ANZALTA FEEHI MINAL QUR'AAN\nthe Lord of the month of Ramadan and the Qur'an that You have revealed during it,\nوَرَبَّ جَبْرَئِيْلَ وَمِيْكَاۤئِيْلَ وَاِسْرَافِيْلَ وَعِزْرَاۤئِيْلَ\nWA RABBA JABRA'EELA WA MEEKAA'EELA WA ISRAAFEELA WA I'ZRAA'EEL\nthe Lord of (Archangels) Gabriel, Michael, Seraph, and 'Izra’il,\nوَجَمِيْعِ الْمَلَآئِكَةِ الْمُقَرَّبِيْنَ\nWA JAMEE'IL MALAA'IKATIL MUQARRABEEN\nas well as all the Favorite Angels,\nوَرَبَّ اِبْرَاهِيْمَ وَاِسْمَاعِيْلَ\nWA RABBA IBRAAHEEMA WA ISMAA'EEL\nthe Lord of (Prophets) Abraham, Ishmael,\nوَاِسْحَاقَ وَيَعْقُوْبَ\nWA IS-HAAQA WA YA'QOOB\nIsaac, and Jacob,\nوَرَبَّ مُوسٰى وَعِيْسٰی\nWA RABBA MOOSAA WA I'EESAA\nthe Lord of Moses and Jesus,\nوَجَمِيْعِ النَّبِيِّيْنَ وَالْمُرْسَلِيْنَ\nWA JAMEE'IN NABIYYEENA WAL MURSALEEN\nas well as all the Prophets and Messengers,\nوَرَبَّ مُحَمَّدٍ خَاتَمِ النَّبِيِّيْنَ\nWA RABBA MUHAMMADIN KHAATAMIN NABIYYEEN\nand the Lord of Muhammad, the seal of the Prophets,\nصَلَوَاتُكَ عَلَيْهِ وَعَلَيْهِمْ اَجْمَعِيْنَ\nSALAWAATUKA A'LAYHI WA A'LAYHIM AJMA'EEN\nmay Your blessings be upon him and upon them all.\nوَاَسْاَلُكَ بِحَقِّكَ عَلَيْهِمْ وَبِحَقِّهِمْ عَلَيْكَ\nWA AS'ALUKA BIHAQQIKA A'LAYHIM WA BIHAQQIHIM A'LAYK\nI beseech You in the name of their duty towards You Your duty towards them,\nوَبِحَقِّكَ الْعَظِيْمِ لَمَّا صَلَّيْتَ عَلَيْهِ وَاٰلِهِ وَعَلَيْهِمْ اَجْمَعِيْنَ\nWA BIHAQQIKAL A'ZEEMI LAMMAA SALLAYTA A'LAYHI WA AALIHEE WA A'LAYHIM AJMA'EEN\nand in the name of the great duty towards You to bless him and his Household and all of them,\nوَنَظَرْتَ اِلَيَّ نَظْرَةً رَحِيْمَةً\nWA NAZARTA ILAYYA NAZRATAN RAHEEMAH\nto take a merciful look at me\nتَرْضٰى بِهَا عَنِّي رِضىً لَا سَخَطَ عَلَيَّ بَعْدَهٗ اَبَدًا\nTARDAA BIHAA A'NNEE RIDAN LAA SAKHATA A'LAYYA BA'DAHOO ABADAA\ndue to which You be pleased with me so perfectly that You never be irate with me after that,\nوَاَعْطَيْتَنِيْ جَمِيْعَ سُؤْلِيْ وَرَغْبَتِيْ وَاُمْنِيَّتِيْ وَاِرَادَتِيْ\nWA A'TAYTANEE JAMEE'A SU'LEE WA RAGHBATEE WA UMNIYYATEE WA IRAADATEE\nto grant me all my requests, desires, hopes, and needs,\nوَصَرَفْتَ عَنِّي مَا اَكْرَهُ وَاَحْذَرُ\nWA SARAFTA A'NNEE MAA AKRAHOO WA AHDHAR\nto ward off all that which I despise and try to avoid\nوَاَخَافُ عَلٰى نَفْسِيْ وَمَا لَا اَخَافُ\nWA AKHAAFU A'LAA NAFSEE WA MAA LAA AKHAAF\nand all that which I fear for myself and all that which I do not fear,\nوَعَنْ اَهْلِيْ وَمَالِيْ وَاِخْوَانِيْ وَذُرِّيَّتِيْ\nWA A'N AHLEE WA MAALEE WA IKHWAANEE WA DHURRIYYATEE\nand to do the same to my family members, my property, my brethren and my offspring.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ اِلَيْكَ فَرَرْنَا مِنْ ذُنُوْبِنَا فَاٰوِنَا تَآئِبِيْنَ\nALLAAHUMMA ILAYKA FARARNAA MIN DHUNOOBINAA FA-AAWINAA TAA'IBEEN\nO Allah, to You are we running from our sins; so (please do) shelter us as we are repentant,\nوَتُبْ عَلَيْنَا مُسْتَغْفِرِيْنَ\nWA TUB A'LAYNAA MUSTAGHFIREEN\naccept our repentance as we are seeking Your forgiveness,\nوَاغْفِرْ لَنَا مُتَعَوِّذِيْنَ\nWAGHFIR LANAA MUTA'AWWIDHEEN\nforgive us as we are seeking Your protection,\nوَاَعِذْنَا مُسْتَجِيْرِيْنَ\nWA A'IDHNAA MUSTAJEEREEN\nprotect us as we are seeking Your aid,\nوَاَجِرْنَا مُسْتَسْلِمِيْنَ\nWA AJIRNAA MUSTASLIMEEN\naid us as we are surrendering to You,\nوَلَا تَخْذُلْنَا رَاهِبِيْنَ\nWA LAA TAKHDHULNAA RAAHIBEEN\nnever disappoint us as we are fearful of You,\nوَاٰمِنَّا رَاغِبِيْنَ\nWA AAMINNAA RAAGHIBEEN\nsecure us as we are desiring for You,\nوَشَفِّعْنَا سَاۤئِلِيْنَ\nWA SHAFFI'NAA SAA'ILEEN\naccept our intercession as we are begging You,\nوَاَعْطِنَا اِنَّكَ سَمِيْعُ الدُّعَاۤءِ قَرِيْبٌ مُجِيْبٌ\nWA A'TINAA INNAKA SAMEE'UD DU'AA'I QAREEBUN MUJEEB\nand grant us (what we hope) as You are verily the Hearer of prayers, the Nigh, and the Responding.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ اَنْتَ رَبِّيْ وَاَنَا عَبْدُكَ\nALLAAHUMMA ANTA RABBEE WA ANAA A'BDUK\nO Allah, You are my Lord and I am Your servant,\nوَاَحَقُّ مَنْ سَاَلَ الْعَبْدُ رَبَّهٗ\nWA AHAQQU MAN SA'ALAL A'BDU RABBAH\nand it is conventional that a servant begs from his Lord.\nوَلَمْ يَسْاَلِ الْعِبَادُ مِثْلَكَ كَرَمًا وَجُوْدًا\nWA LAM YAS'ALIL I'BAADU MITHLAKA KARAMAN WA JOODAA\nAll Your servants have never begged any one who is as generous and magnanimous as You are.\nيَا مَوْضِعَ شَكْوٰى السَّاۤئِلِيْنَ\nYAA MAWDI'A SHAKWAS SAA'ILEEN\nO center of the complaints of the beseechers!\nوَيَا مُنْتَهٰى حَاجَةِ الرَّاغِبِيْنَ\nWA YAA MUNTAHAA HAAJATIR RAAGHIBEEN\nO ultimate goal of the needs of the desirers!\nوَيَا غِيَاثَ الْمُسْتَغِيْثِيْنَ\nWA YAA GHIYAATHAL MUSTAGHEETHEEN\nO Aide of the seekers of aid!\nوَيَا مُجِيْبَ دَعْوَةِ الْمُضْطَرِّيْنَ\nWA YAA MUJEEBA DA'WATIL MUDTARREEN\nO Responding to the prayers of the distressed ones!\nوَيَا مَلْجَاَ الْهَارِبِيْنَ\nWA YAA MALJA'AL HAARIBEEN\nO Shelter of the fugitives!\nوَيَا صَرِيْخَ الْمُسْتَصْرِخِيْنَ\nWA YAA SAREEKHAL MUSTASRIKHEEN\nO Helper of the seekers of help!\nوَيَا رَبَّ الْمُسْتَضْعَفِيْنَ\nWA YAA RABBAL MUSTAD'AFEEN\nO Cherisher of the enfeebled ones!\nوَيَا كَاشِفَ كَرْبِ الْمَكْرُوْبِيْنَ\nWA YAA KAASHIFA KARBIL MAKROOBEEN\nO Reliever of the grievances of the aggrieved ones!\nوَيَا فَارِجَ هَمِّ الْمَهْمُوْمِيْنَ\nWA YAA FAARIJA HAMMIL MAHMOOMEEN\nO Releaser of the agonies of the distressed ones!\nوَيَا كَاشِفَ الْكَرْبِ الْعَظِيْمِ\nWA YAA KAASHIFAL KARBIL A'ZEEM\nO Reliever of the enormous calamities!\nيَا اَللهُ يَا رَحْمٰنُ يَا رَحِيْمُ\nYAA ALLAAHU YAA RAHMAANU YAA RAHEEM\nO Allah! O All-beneficent! O All-merciful!\nيَا اَرْحَمَ الرَّاحِمِيْنَ\nYAA ARHAMAR RAAHIMEEN\nO most Merciful of all those who show mercy!\nصَلِّ عَلٰى مُحَمَّدٍ وَاٰلِ مُحَمَّدٍ\nSALLI A'LAA MUHAMMADIN WA AALI MUHAMMAD\n(Please) bless Muhammad and the Household of Muhammad,\nوَاغْفِرْ لِيْ ذُنُوْبِيْ وَعُيُوْبِيْ\nWAGHFIR LEE DHUNOOBEE WA U'YOOBEE\nforgive my sins, my defects,\nوَاِسَاۤءَتِيْ وَظُلْمِيْ وَجُرْمِيْ\nWA ISAA'ATEE WA ZULMEE WA JURMEE\nmy offenses, my wrongdoing, my felonies,\nوَاِسْرَافِيْ عَلٰى نَفْسِيْ\nWA ISRAAFEE A'LAA NAFSEE\nand my extravagance in my affairs,\nوَارْزُقْنِيْ مِنْ فَضْلِكَ وَرَحْمَتِكَ\nWARZUQNEE MIN FADLIKA WA RAHMATIK\ngrant me out of Your favors and mercy,\nفَاِنَّهٗ لَا يَمْلِكُهَا غَيْرُكَ\nFA-INNAHOO LAA YAMLIKUHAA GHAYRUK\nfor none possesses these two save You,\nوَاعْفُ عَنِّيْ\nWA'FU A'NNEE\npardon me,\nوَاغْفِرْ لِيْ كُلَّ مَا سَلَفَ مِنْ ذُنُوْبِيْ\nWAGHFIR LEE KULLA MAA SALAFA MIN DHUNOOBEE\nforgive all my past sins,\nوَاعْصِمْنِيْ فِيْمَا بَقِيَ مِنْ عُمْرِيْ\nWA'SIMNEE FEEMAA BAQIYA MIN U'MREE\nsave me from sinning in the rest of my lifetime,\nوَاسْتُرْ عَلَيَّ وَعَلٰى وَالِدَيَّ\nWASTUR A'LAYYA WA A'LAA WAALIDAYY\ncover me as well as my parents,\nوَوَلَدِيْ وَقَرَابَتِيْ وَاَهْلِ حُزَانَتِيْ\nWA WALADEE WA QARAABATEE WA AHLI HUZAANATEE\nmy children, my relatives, my friends,\nوَمَنْ كَانَ مِنِّي بِسَبِيْلٍ مِنَ الْمُؤْمِنِيْنَ وَالْمُؤْمِنَاتِ فِيْ الدُّنْيَا وَالْاٰخِرَةِ\nWA MAN KAANA MINNEE BISABEELIN MINAL MU'MINEENA WAL MU'MINAATI FID DUNYAA WAL AAKHIRAH\nand all those who relate to me from the believing men and women in this worldly life and the life to come.\nفَاِنَّ ذٰلِكَ كُلَّهٗ بِيَدِكَ\nFA-INNA DHAALIKA KULLAHOO BIYADIK\nVerily, all that is managed by You alone\nوَاَنْتَ وَاسِعُ الْمَغْفِرَةِ\nWA ANTA WAASI'UL MAGHFIRAH\nand You are verily the Liberal in forgiving.\nفَلَا تُخَيِّبْنِيْ يَا سَيِّدِيْ\nFALAA TUKHAYYIBNEE YAA SAYYIDEE\nSo, my Master, do not disappoint me,\nوَلَا تَرُدَّ دُعَاۤئِيْ وَلَا يَدِيْ اِلٰى نَحْرِيْ\nWA LAA TARUDDA DU'AA'EE WA LAA YADEE ILAA NAHREE\ndo not reject my prayer, and do not let me down;\nحَتّٰى تَفْعَلَ ذٰلِكَ بِيْ وَتَسْتَجِيْبَ لِيْ جَمِيْعَ مَا سَاَلْتُكَ\nHATTAA TAF'ALA DHAALIKA BEE WA TASTAJEEBA LEE JAMEE'A MAA SA'ALTUK\nrather, (please) do all that to me, respond to me in all that which I have asked from You,\nوَتَزِيْدَنِيْ مِنْ فَضْلِكَ\nWA TAZEEDANEE MIN FADLIK\nand increase Your favor upon me,\nفَاِنَّكَ عَلٰى كُلِّ شَيْءٍ قَدِيْرٌ\nFA-INNAKA A'LAA KULLI SHAY'IN QADEER\nbecause You verily have power over all things\nوَنَحْنُ اِلَيْكَ رَاغِبُوْنَ\nWA NAHNU ILAYKA RAAGHIBOON\nand for You do we desire.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ لَكَ الْاَسْمَاۤءُ الْحُسْنٰى\nALLAAHUMMA LAKAL ASMAA'UL HUSNAA\nO Allah, Yours are the Most Excellent Names,\nوَالْاَمْثَالُ الْعُلْيَا\nWAL AMTHAALUL U'LYAA\nthe Most Elevated Examples,\nوَالْكِبْرِيَاۤءُ وَالْاٰلَاۤءُ\nWAL KIBRIYAA'U WAL AALAA'\nevery greatness, and all bounties.\nاَسْاَلُكَ بِاسْمِكَ\nAS'ALUKA BISMIK\nI thus beseech You by Your Name:\nبِسْمِ اللهِ الرَّحْمٰنِ الرَّحِيْمِ\nBISMILLAAHIR RAHMAANIR RAHEEM\nIn the Name of Allah, the All-beneficent, the All-merciful.\nاِنْ كُنْتَ قَضَيْتَ فِيْ هٰذِهِ اللَّيْلَةِ\nIN KUNTA QADAYTA FEE HAADHIHIL LAYLAH\nIf you have decided at this night,\nتَنَزُّلَ الْمَلَآئِكَةِ وَالرُّوْحِ فِيْهَا\nTANAZZULAL MALAA'IKATI WAR ROOHI FEEHAA\nduring which the angels and the Holy Spirit are allowed to descend,\nاَنْ تُصَلِّيَ عَلٰى مُحَمَّدٍ وَاٰلِ مُحَمَّدٍ\nAN TUSALLIYA A'LAA MUHAMMADIN WA AALI MUHAMMAD\nto bless Muhammad and the Household of Muhammad,\nوَاَنْ تَجْعَلَ اسْمِيْ فِيْ السُّعَدَاۤءِ\nWA AN TAJ'ALAS MEE FIS SU'ADAA'\nadd my name to the (list of the) happy ones,\nوَرُوْحِيْ مَعَ الشُّهَدَاۤءِ\nWA ROOHEE MA'ASH SHUHADAA'\nadd my soul to the martyrs,\nوَاِحْسَانِيْ فِيْ عِلِّيِّيْنَ\nWA IHSAANEE FEE I'LLIYYEEN\nelevate my good doings exaltedly,\nوَاِسَاۤءَتِيْ مَغْفُوْرَةً\nWA ISAA'ATEE MAGHFOORAH\ndecide my ill deeds to be forgiven,\nوَاَنْ تَهَبَ لِيْ يَقِيْنًا تُبَاشِرُ بِهٖ قَلْبِيْ\nWA AN TAHABA LEE YAQEENAN TUBAASHIRU BIHEE QALBEE\ngrant me conviction with which You fill in my heart,\nوَاِيْمَانًا لَا يَشُوْبُهٗ شَكٌّ\nWA EEMAANAN LAA YASHOOBUHOO SHAKK\nfaith free of doubt,\nوَرِضىً بِمَا قَسَمْتَ لِيْ\nWA RIDAN BIMAA QASAMTA LEE\nsatisfaction with that which You decide for me,\nوَاٰتِنِيْ فِيْ الدُّنْيَا حَسَنَةً وَفِي الْاٰخِرَةِ حَسَنَةً\nWA AATINEE FID DUNYAA HASANATAN WA FIL AAKHIRATI HASANAH\ngrant me good in this worldly life and good in the Next World,\nوَقِنِيْ عَذَابَ النَّارِ\nWA QINEE A'DHAABAN NAAR\nand save me from the Fire of Hell.\nوَاِنْ لَمْ تَكُنْ قَضَيْتَ فِيْ هٰذِهِ اللَّيْلَةِ\nWA IN LAM TAKUN QADAYTA FEE HAADHIHIL LAYLAH\nAnd if You have not decided at this night,\nتَنَزُّلَ الْمَلَآئِكَةِ وَالرُّوْحِ فِيْهَا\nTANAZZULAL MALAA'IKATI WAR ROOHI FEEHAA\nduring which the angels and the Holy Spirit are allowed to descend,\nفَاَخِّرْنِيْ اِلٰى ذٰلِكَ\nFA-AKHKHIRNEE ILAA DHAALIK\nthen (please) postpone Your decisions about me to that night,\nوَارْزُقْنِيْ فِيْهَا ذِكْرَكَ وَشُكْرَكَ\nWARZUQNEE FEEHAA DHIKRAKA WA SHUKRAK\nconfer upon me during it with remembering You, showing gratitude to You,\nوَطَاعَتَكَ وَحُسْنَ عِبَادَتِكَ\nWA TAA'ATAKA WA HUSNA I'BAADATIK\ndoing acts of obedience to You, and worshipping You in the best manner.\nوَصَلِّ عَلٰى مُحَمَّدٍ وَاٰلِ مُحَمَّدٍ\nWA SALLI A'LAA MUHAMMADIN WA AALI MUHAMMAD\nAnd (please) bless Muhammad and the Household of Muhammad\nبِاَفْضَلِ صَلَوَاتِكَ يَآ اَرْحَمَ الرَّاحِمِيْنَ\nBI-AFDALI SALAWAATIKA YAA ARHAMAR RAAHIMEEN\nwith Your most favorable blessings, O most Merciful of all those who show mercy!\nيَا اَحَدُ يَا صَمَدُ\nYAA AHADU YAA SAMAD\nO One and Only! the Besought of all!\nيَا رَبَّ مُحَمَّدٍ\nYAA RABBA MUHAMMAD\nO Lord of Muhammad!\nاغْضَبِ الْيَوْمَ لِمُحَمَّدٍ وَلِاَبْرَارِ عِتْرَتِهٖ\nIGHDABIL YAWMA LIMUHAMMADIN WA LI-ABRAARI I'TRATIH\n(please) revenge on this day for Muhammad and for the pious ones from his offspring,\nوَاقْتُلْ اَعْدَاۤءَهُمْ بَدَدًا\nWAQTUL A'DAA'AHUM BADADAA\neradicate all of their enemies,\nوَاَحْصِهِمْ عَدَدًا\nWA AHSIHIM A'DADAA\nput them all under Your reprimand,\nوَلَا تَدَعْ عَلٰى ظَهْرِ الْاَرْضِ مِنْهُمْ اَحَدًا\nWA LAA TADA' A'LAA ZAHRIL ARDI MINHUM AHADAA\ndo not leave anyone of them to live on this earth,\nوَلَا تَغْفِرْ لَهُمْ اَبَدًا\nWA LAA TAGHFIR LAHUM ABADAA\nand never forgive them.\nيَا حَسَنَ الصُّحْبَةِ\nYAA HASANAS SUHBAH\nO most excellent Companion!\nيَا خَلِيْفَةَ النَّبِيِّيْنَ\nYAA KHALEEFATAN NABIYYEEN\nO Heir of the Prophets!\nاَنْتَ اَرْحَمُ الرَّاحِمِيْنَ\nANTA ARHAMUR RAAHIMEEN\nYou are verily the most Merciful of all those who show mercy,\nالْبَدِيْءُ الْبَدِيْعُ\nAL-BADEE'UL BADEE'\nthe Commencer, the brilliant Maker,\nالَّذِيْ لَيْسَ كَمِثْلِكَ شَيْءٌ\nALLADHEE LAYSA KAMITHLIKA SHAY'\nthere is none like You,\nوَالدَّآئِمُ غَيْرُ الْغَافِلِ\nWAD DAA'IMU GHAYRUL GHAAFIL\nYou are the Eternal Who never omits anything,\nوَالْحَيُّ الَّذِيْ لَا يَمُوْتُ\nWAL HAYYUL LADHEE LAA YAMOOT\nare the Ever-living Who never dies,\nاَنْتَ كُلَّ يَوْمٍ فِيْ شَاْنٍ\nANTA KULLA YAWMIN FEE SHA'N\non each day, You have a certain state.\nاَنْتَ خَلِيْفَةُ مُحَمَّدٍ\nANTA KHALEEFATU MUHAMMAD\nYou are the Heir of Muhammad,\nوَنَاصِرُ مُحَمَّدٍ\nWA NAASIRU MUHAMMAD\nthe Supporter of Muhammad,\nوَمُفَضِّلُ مُحَمَّدٍ\nWA MUFADDILU MUHAMMAD\nand the Selector of Muhammad.\nاَسْاَلُكَ اَنْ تَنْصُرَ وَصِيَّ مُحَمَّدٍ وَخَلِيْفَةَ مُحَمَّدٍ\nAS'ALUKA AN TANSURA WASIYYA MUHAMMADIN WA KHALEEFATA MUHAMMAD\nI beseech You to give victory to the successor and representative of Muhammad,\nوَالْقَآئِمَ بِالْقِسْطِ مِنْ اَوْصِيَاۤءِ مُحَمَّدٍ\nWAL QAA'IMA BIL QISTI MIN AWSIYAA'I MUHAMMAD\nthe Imam who shall appear with justice among the successors of Muhammad,\nصَلَوَاتُكَ عَلَيْهِ وَعَلَيْهِمْ\nSALAWAATUKA A'LAYHI WA A'LAYHIM\nmay Your blessings be upon him and upon them.\nاِعْطِفْ عَلَيْهِمْ نَصْرَكَ\nI'TIF A'LAYHIM NASRAK\n(Please) turn Your victory toward them.\nيَا لَا اِلٰهَ اِلَّا اَنْتَ\nYAA LAA ILAAHA ILLAA ANT\nO He but Whom there is no god!\nبِحَقِّ لَآ اِلٰهَ اِلَّا اَنْتَ\nBIHAQQI LAA ILAAHA ILLAA ANT\nI beseech You in the name of that there is no god but You,\nصَلِّ عَلٰى مُحَمَّدٍ وَاٰلِ مُحَمَّدٍ\nSALLI A'LAA MUHAMMADIN WA AALI MUHAMMAD\n(please do) bless Muhammad and the Household of Muhammad,\nوَاجْعَلْنِيْ مَعَهُمْ فِي الدُّنْيَا وَالْاٰخِرَةِ\nWAJ'ALNEE MA'AHUM FID DUNYAA WAL AAKHIRAH\nallow me to join them in this worldly life as well as the Next World\nوَاجْعَلْ عَاقِبَةَ اَمْرِيْ اِلٰى غُفْرَانِكَ وَرَحْمَتِكَ\nWAJ'AL A'AQIBATA AMREE ILAA GHUFRAANIKA WA RAHMATIK\nand allow all my affairs to end up with Your forgiveness and mercy.\nيَا اَرْحَمَ الرَّاحِمِيْنَ\nYAA ARHAMAR RAAHIMEEN\nO most Merciful of all those who show mercy!\nوَكَذٰلِكَ نَسَبْتَ نَفْسَكَ يَا سَيِّدِيْ بِاللَّطِيْفِ\nWA KADHAALIKA NASABTA NAFSAKA YAA SAYYIDEE BIL LATEEF\nO my Master, You have ascribed the feature of kindness to Yourself.\nبَلٰى اِنَّكَ لَطِيْفٌ\nBALAA INNAKA LATEEF\nYes, indeed! You are truly kind.\nفَصَلِّ عَلٰى مُحَمَّدٍ وَاٰلِ مُحَمَّدٍ\nFASALLI A'LAA MUHAMMADIN WA AALI MUHAMMAD\nSo, (please) bless Muhammad and the Household of Muhammad\nوَالْطُفْ لِمَا تَشَاۤءُ\nWALTUF LIMAA TASHAA'\nand treat me kindly as You like.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ صَلِّ عَلٰى مُحَمَّدٍ وَاٰلِ مُحَمَّدٍ\nALLAAHUMMA SALLI A'LAA MUHAMMADIN WA AALI MUHAMMAD\nO Allah, (please) bless Muhammad and the Household of Muhammad,\nوَارْزُقْنِى الْحَجَّ وَالْعُمْرَةَ فِيْ عَامِنَا هٰذَا\nWARZUQNIL HAJJA WAL U'MRATA FEE A'AMINAA HAADHAA\ngrant me (the opportunity to go on) Hajj and 'Umrah in this year,\nوَتَطَوَّلْ عَلَيَّ بِجَمِيْعِ حَوَآئِجِيْ لِلْاٰخِرَةِ وَالدُّنْيَا\nWA TATAWWAL A'LAYYA BIJAMEE'I HAWAA'IJEE LIL AAKHIRATI WAD DUNYAA\nconfer upon me with the favor of settling all my needs for the Next World and this worldly life.\nThen recite 3 times:\nاَسْتَغْفِرُ اللهَ رَبِّي وَاَتُوْبُ اِلَيْهِ\nASTAGHFIRULLAAHA RABBEE WA ATOOBU ILAYH\nI implore for the forgiveness of Allah, my Lord, and I repent before Him.\nاِنَّ رَبِّي قَرِيْبٌ مُجِيْبٌ\nINNA RABBEE QAREEBUN MUJEEB\nSurely, my Lord is Nigh and Responding.\nاَسْتَغْفِرُ اللهَ رَبِّي وَاَتُوْبُ اِلَيْهِ\nASTAGHFIRULLAAHA RABBEE WA ATOOBU ILAYH\nI implore for Allah’s forgiveness, my Lord, and I repent before Him,\nاِنَّ رَبِّيْ رَحِيْمٌ وَدُوْدٌ\nINNA RABBEE RAHEEMUN WADOOD\nSurely, my Lord is Merciful, Loving.\nاَسْتَغْفِرُ اللهَ رَبِّي وَاَتُوْبُ اِلَيْهِ\nASTAGHFIRULLAAHA RABBEE WA ATOOBU ILAYH\nI implore for Allah’s forgiveness, my Lord, and I repent before Him.\nاِنَّهٗ كَانَ غَفَّارًا\nINNAHOO KAANA GHAFFAARAA\nHe is surely All-forgiving.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ اغْفِرْ لِيْ\nALLAAHUMMAGH FIR LEE\nO Allah, (please do) forgive me.\nاِنَّكَ اَرْحَمُ الرَّاحِمِيْنَ\nINNAKA ARHAMUR RAAHIMEEN\nYou are verily the most Merciful of all those who show mercy.\nرَبِّ اِنِّيْ عَمِلْتُ سُوٓءًا وَظَلَمْتُ نَفْسِيْ\nRABBI INNEE A'MILTU SOO'AN WA ZALAMTU NAFSEE\nO my Lord, I have committed ill deeds and wronged myself.\nفَاغْفِرْ لِيْ اِنَّهٗ لَا يَغْفِرُ الذُّنُوْبَ اِلَّا اَنْتَ\nFAGHFIR LEE INNAHOO LAA YAGHFIRUDH DHUNOOBA ILLAA ANT\nSo (please) forgive me, because none can forgive sins save You.\nاَسْتَغْفِرُ اللهَ الَّذِيْ لَا اِلٰهَ اِلَّا هُوَ\nASTAGHFIRULLAAHAL LADHEE LAA ILAAHA ILLAA HUW\nI implore for Allah’s forgiveness save Whom there is no god,\nالْحَيُّ الْقَيُّوْمُ الْحَلِيْمُ الْعَظِيْمُ\nAL-HAYYUL QAYYOOMUL HALEEMUL A'ZEEM\nthe Ever-living, the Self-Subsistent, the Indulgent, the All-great,\nالْكَرِيْمُ الْغَفَّارُ لِلذَّنْبِ الْعَظِيْمِ\nAL-KAREEMUL GHAFFAARU LIDH DHANBIL A'ZEEM\nthe Noble, the forgiver of fatal sins,\nوَاَتُوْبُ اِلَيْهِ\nWA ATOOBU ILAYH\nand I repent before Him.\nاَسْتَغْفِرُ اللهَ\nASTAGHFIRULLAAH\nI implore for Allah’s forgiveness.\nاِنَّ اللهَ كَانَ غَفُورًا رَحِيْمًا\nINNALLAAHA KAANA GHAFOORAN RAHEEMAA\nAllah is verily Forgiver, Merciful.\nThen keep on reciting:\nاَللّٰهُمَّ اِنِّيْ اَسْاَلُكَ اَنْ تُصَلِّيَ عَلٰى مُحَمَّدٍ وَاٰلِ مُحَمَّدٍ\nALLAAHUMMA INNEE AS'ALUKA AN TUSALLIYA A'LAA MUHAMMADIN WA AALI MUHAMMAD\nO Allah, I beseech You to send blessings to Muhammad and the Household of Muhammad,\nوَاَنْ تَجْعَلَ فِيْمَا تَقْضِيْ وَتُقَدِّرُ\nWA AN TAJ'ALA FEEMAA TAQDEE WA TUQADDIR\nto decide within the decisions that You make,\nمِنَ الْاَمْرِ الْعَظِيْمِ الْمَحْتُومِ فِيْ لَيْلَةِ الْقَدْرِ\nMINAL AMRIL A'ZEEMIL MAHTOOMI FEE LAYLATIL QADR\nfrom the great, inevitable affair at the Destiny Night,\nمِنَ الْقَضَاۤءِ الَّذِيْ لَا يُرَدُّ وَلَا يُبَدَّلُ\nMINAL QADAA'IL LADHEE LAA YURADDU WA LAA YUBADDAL\nwithin the decision that is neither rejected nor altered,\nاَنْ تَكْتُبَنِيْ مِنْ حُجَّاجِ بَيْتِكَ الْحَرَامِ\nAN TAKTUBANEE MIN HUJJAAJI BAYTIKAL HARAAM\nto write my name with the pilgrims of Your Holy House,\nالْمَبْرُوْرِ حَجُّهُمْ\nAL-MABROORI HAJJUHUM\nwhose Hajj is admitted,\nالْمَشْكُوْرِ سَعْيُهُمْ\nAL-MASHKOORI SA'YUHUM\nwhose efforts are praiseworthy,\nالْمَغْفُوْرِ ذُنُوْبُهُمُ\nAL-MAGHFOORI DHUNOOBUHUM\nwhose sins are forgiven,\nالْمُكَفَّرِ عَنْهُمْ سَيِّئَاتُهُمْ\nAL-MUKAFFARI A'NHUM SAYYI'AATUHUM\nand whose offenses are pardoned,\nوَاَنْ تَجْعَلَ فِيْمَا تَقْضِيْ وَتُقَدِّرُ اَنْ تُطِيْلَ عُمْرِيْ\nWA AN TAJ'ALA FEEMAA TAQDEE WA TUQADDIRU AN TUTEELA U'MREE\nto decide among the decisions that You make to grant me long lifetime,\nوَتُوَسِّعَ فِيْ رِزْقِيْ\nWA TUWASSI'A FEE RIZQEE\nexpand my sustenance,\nوَتُؤَدِّيَ عَنِّيْ اَمَانَتِيْ وَدَيْنِيْ\nWA TU'ADDIYA A'NNEE AMAANATEE WA DAYNEE\nhelp me fulfill my trusts and settle my debts,\nاٰمِيْنَ رَبَّ الْعَالَمِيْنَ\nAAMEENA RABBAL A'ALAMEEN\nand respond to me, O Lord of the worlds.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ اجْعَلْ لِيْ مِنْ اَمْرِيْ فَرَجًا وَمَخْرَجًا\nALLAAHUMMAJ A'L LEE MIN AMREE FARAJAN WA MAKHRAJAA\nO Allah, (please do) make for me relief and an outlet,\nوَارْزُقْنِيْ مِنْ حَيْثُ اَحْتَسِبُ وَمِنْ حَيْثُ لَا اَحْتَسِبُ\nWARZUQNEE MIN HAYTHU AHTASIBU WA MIN HAYTHU LAA AHTASIB\nprovide for me from whence I expect and from whence I do not expect,\nوَاحْرُسْنِيْ مِنْ حَيْثُ اَحْتَرِسُ وَمِنْ حَيْثُ لَا اَحْتَرِسُ\nWAHRUSNEE MIN HAYTHU AHTARISU WA MIN HAYTHU LAA AHTARIS\nguard me from when I take precautions and from whence I do not take precautions,\nوَصَلِّ عَلٰى مُحَمَّدٍ وَاٰلِ مُحَمَّدٍ وَسَلِّمْ كَثِيْرًا\nWA SALLI A'LAA MUHAMMADIN WA AALI MUHAMMADIN WA SALLIM KATHEERAA\nand send plentiful blessings and benedictions to Muhammad and the Household of Muhammad.",
  "merits": "It is recommended to say this supplicatory prayer on the days of Ramadan; it is mentioned by Shaykh al-Tusi and Sayyid Ibn Tawus."
}
